 three  the solution is the solution is not  rather I'm going to learn the other  three and suck at them and hate them  because I need that to be successful the  solution is to focus on the two you're  really good at and get other people to  do the other things right if you're  passionate about something and other  people are attracted that passion their  passion for the same thing but bring  different skill sets then you're going  to work really really really well  together so you know an example making  these videos christina edits all these  videos hi Christina and she believes in  entrepreneurs she believes and believe  she loves the mission that we're on and  she has way better video editing skills  than I do right if the videos relied on  me to edit  and add the music and add all the stuff  that Cristina adds to it first of all we  take way longer I couldn't do as many I  couldn't answer as many questions for  you and second of all I would I would  slowly hate it right like ah I just want  to get in front of the camera and  respond the people I don't want to have  to do all that post-production work but  Cristina is awesome at it and she makes  these stories pop a little more than  just then I would be able to do you  surround yourself with people who who  can support you and you want to build a  success team to take you where you want  to go the third thing is leverage your  strengths if you want to think what are  you really good all right what can you  be one of the best in the world at and  really focus on those things so for  example as I said I'm not the guy going  out making sales calls and cold calling  and going to trade shows and doing  networking events and that is one way to  drum up sales right and it works it's  work for a lot of people but it it won't  work for me because that's not my  personality I'm too introverted to go  out and do all that stuff and so I I've  leveraged my strengths and focus on  marketing instead of sales to help drive  business to me it's a lot easier at  least for me when people are calling and  are interested in what I'm doing and  want to work together then for me to  pick up the phone and cold call somebody  and say hey I'm Evan do you want to work  together and so I've created an engine  that creates an inflow of leads for me  and that is through making the videos  that's through my website that's through  my newsletters through my social media  stuff I'm putting out stuff and building  an audience and that attracts people to  me to want to work together with me on a  whole bunch of different projects so you  know if you're not that kind of sales  person II out meet meet and greet  getting everybody's face kind of guy  then you can focus more on the marketing  side and again pouring your passion into  it right you can express yourself you  have to make videos okay you don't have  to be super comfortable on camera you  don't to do interviews but find the  medium that works best for you maybe you  love time to think and to write and so  thoughtful blog post is what you come up  with or Twitter is your platform or  Facebook is your platform maybe you like  designing you know pictures are taking  taking your own pictures  Photography and matching them with  quotes or whatever it is right fine  whatever medium works best for you that  you can express your passion through and  just leverage the heck out of that one  make it awesome I want to feel your  passion coming through everything that  you create the the acid test for me in  creating something that goes to social  is what am i proud of this you know when  I post that tweet am i proud of what I  just created when I put that picture on  Facebook and my am i proud I feel like  yeah I created that I'm gifting this to  the world  and I think other people will be  inspired by it right so you have to have  that same feeling of I'm really proud of  what I'm creating what I'm doing and  pouring my heart into this message for  you to consume and that will lead you to  have success on social media whether  you're doing it in Twitter or Facebook  or YouTube videos where you're on camera  or making your you know music videos or  whatever you're going to do love with  your strengths and pour your heart into  it so remember follow your passion build  a team leverage your strengths believe  those are watching if you like this  video you can support me by clicking on  the link in the description leave a  comment below let me know what you think  your comments means so much to me I love  seeing them come in and click on my face  subscribe to the channel thank you so  much I'll see you soon
 

